{"indicator":"covid-deaths","unit":"每 10 萬人","years":[2020,2021,2022,2023,2024,2025],"notes":{"TWN":"WHO 的 COVID-19 資料沒有單獨列出台灣（台灣通報的確診死亡含在 WHO 的「中國」數字裡）。這裡用衛福部死因統計裡死因是 COVID-19（ICD-10 U07）的人數累計：2020 年 28、2021 年 896、2022 年 14,667、2023 年 8,962、2024 年 2,962、2025 年 932 人，2025 年底累計 28,447 人。疾管署（中央流行疫情指揮中心）通報的確診死亡累計是 2020 年底 7、2021 年底 850、2022 年底 15,253 人、2023-02-22 為 17,672 人，2023 年 3 月 20 日起只通報併發重症，所以接不到之後的年份。","CHN":"WHO 的「中國」含香港、澳門與台灣通報的確診死亡：2022-11-30 WHO 的中國累計 30,388 人，JHU 分開列的中國大陸 5,233、香港 10,747、澳門 6、台灣 14,334 人，加起來 30,320 人。每 10 萬人的分母只有中國大陸的人口。"},"notesEn":{"TWN":"The WHO COVID-19 data do not list Taiwan separately (deaths reported by Taiwan are included in WHO's figure for China). Taiwan's figure here is the cumulative number of deaths with COVID-19 (ICD-10 U07) as the underlying cause in Ministry of Health and Welfare cause-of-death statistics: 28 in 2020, 896 in 2021, 14,667 in 2022, 8,962 in 2023, 2,962 in 2024, 932 in 2025; 28,447 by the end of 2025. Confirmed deaths reported by Taiwan CDC (the Central Epidemic Command Center) were 7 at the end of 2020, 850 at the end of 2021, 15,253 at the end of 2022, and 17,672 on 2023-02-22; from 20 March 2023 only severe cases were reported, so that series cannot be extended.","CHN":"WHO's figure for China includes confirmed deaths reported by Hong Kong, Macao and Taiwan: on 2022-11-30 WHO's cumulative total for China was 30,388, while JHU listed 5,233 for mainland China, 10,747 for Hong Kong, 6 for Macao and 14,334 for Taiwan, 30,320 in all. The per-100,000 rate uses the population of mainland China only."},"encoding":"delta","aggregates":{"WLD":[-1,243,445,156,37,9,3]},"values":{"AFG":[-1,54,127,12,3,1,0],"ALB":[-1,414,722,136,3,1,0],"DZA":[-1,60,78,13,0,0,0],"ASM":[-1,0,0,703,0,0,0],"AND":[-1,1054,702,226,12,0,0],"AGO":[-1,11,38,5,0,0,0],"AIA":[-1,0,352,493,0,0,0],"ATG":[-1,54,1228,290,0,0,0],"ARG":[-1,1063,1540,263,7,6,2],"ARM":[-1,980,1787,256,23,3,0],"ABW":[-1,455,1224,919,111,0,0],"AUS":[-1,35,58,629,207,34,0],"A